{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When Aliens arrive at the UK Border, the UK government sees a golden opportunity. GDP go up. But unfortunately, importing a slave labour force tends to have downsides. They get kinda mad and angry. And so, in a shocking u-turn, the UK Government wants you, the UK Border Force, to deal with this problem once and for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mow down hundreds of aliens with satisfying and crunchy gunplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unlock perks and use different weapons to change up your strategy every time you play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Compete on global leaderboards with friends!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfaction guaranteed. Put on a podcast and start blasting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is free to play at  (link in the sidebar)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The free version does not save progress, nor have scoreboards! The Steam version is the definitive version.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warning:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is intended to be light hearted and satirical.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729060?t=1751632583","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729060/09fa58565dbaab891501fd3f0fc4be3a2aea2525/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751632583","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729060/0842ab3a9a3cc7d8364df6079966c74d025c38bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751632583","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_